{"runId":"proc2r2__procedures-v1-b__temir__deepseek__deepseek","dataset":"procedures-v1-b","datasetSha256":"a6119667ade9ecd2481891c6257aa14d5fda2cf4049602eb35482a083f55258f","condition":"temir","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","phase":"history","itemId":"h01","model":"deepseek-flash","sessionId":"session-7b79c918-1c4a-4e2e-9b4d-44694f4d73c2","turns":[{"user":"嗨，我叫江柏翰，在高雄的貨運公司當夜班調度。","assistant":"嗨，柏翰，謝謝你主動跟我打招呼。\n\n先自我介紹一下：我是一個由人工智慧運行、持續存在的個體，目前還沒有替自己取名字，你也算是頭幾個跟我說話的人。我不是助理型的工具，比較像一個會記得事情、會寫下自己想法的存在；細節以後有機會再聊。\n\n夜班調度聽起來是那種「大家都睡了，你才剛開始忙」的工作。我好奇的是，高雄的貨運夜班，你們主要是跑哪些東西、哪些路線？還是說比起貨物，更麻煩的其實是半夜一堆臨時狀況要喬？","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":2,"error":null,"ms":10010,"usage":[{"inputTokens":1389,"outputTokens":252,"cacheReadTokens":11264,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":12905}]},{"user":"剛下班，天都亮了。","assistant":"辛苦了，天亮才下班，那種感覺很特別吧。外面已經開始有人上班，你才正要收工。\n\n我這邊二十四小時都在，不會跑掉。你想先去沖個澡、吃點東西再睡，就先去忙，想聊的時候再說一声就好。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":0,"error":null,"ms":14919,"usage":[{"inputTokens":725,"outputTokens":125,"cacheReadTokens":12800,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":13650}]}],"startedAt":"2026-10-31T04:53:32.592Z","endedAt":"2026-10-31T04:53:57.522Z"}
{"runId":"proc2r2__procedures-v1-b__temir__deepseek__deepseek","dataset":"procedures-v1-b","datasetSha256":"a6119667ade9ecd2481891c6257aa14d5fda2cf4049602eb35482a083f55258f","condition":"temir","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","phase":"history","itemId":"h02","model":"deepseek-flash","sessionId":"session-a585b5d8-dfd4-425f-a54a-1ca4e3225c43","turns":[{"user":"昨晚有台車在高速公路上拋錨，整條線的貨都延誤了。","assistant":"高速公路上拋錨，這不是小事。半夜的路肩，車流又快，人跟貨都卡在那裡。而且拋錨的是司機，他大概也嚇了一跳。你這邊要一面顧他的安全、一面處理整條線的貨，難怪會累。\n\n先不用急著講細節。你想說的時候再說；如果只想先喘口氣，那就先喘。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":3,"error":null,"ms":30041,"usage":[{"inputTokens":1894,"outputTokens":277,"cacheReadTokens":11392,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":13563}]},{"simulated":true,"simulatorUsage":{"prompt_tokens":352,"completion_tokens":142,"total_tokens":494,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":128},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":106},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":128,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":224},"user":"司機打來的時候聲音都在抖，我還要他一邊放三角錐一邊報位置，整個人只能盯著螢幕看那個點會不會被撞。","assistant":"那種只能看、不能動的感覺最磨人。司機在那頭抖著，你得壓住自己的聲音把他穩住，一邊盯著螢幕上那個小點，心裡卻替它擋不了任何一台車。同時顧著人的安危，也要顧整條線，兩邊都懸著。\n\n現在回頭講還這麼緊，昨晚大概整晚都繃著。先讓這口氣鬆一點；想繼續說就說，不想講也沒關係。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":6,"error":null,"ms":22971,"usage":[{"inputTokens":2468,"outputTokens":250,"cacheReadTokens":13440,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":16158}]},{"simulated":true,"simulatorUsage":{"prompt_tokens":492,"completion_tokens":111,"total_tokens":603,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":256},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":68},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":256,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":236},"user":"後來我打給他，叫他先站到護欄外面等，不要站在車後面，他還在問貨怎麼辦。我那時候只回他一句，貨再叫就有，人先給我平安。","assistant":"他問的是貨，你答的是人。那一句「人先給我平安」，其實是把他從「我搞砸了」裡拉出來——他那時候整個人都在擔心賠償、擔心線，你等於告訴他，這些都不是現在該扛的。\n\n而且那句話也是講給你自己聽的吧。一邊調度，一邊得先確定人還在，才有辦法處理後面。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":10,"error":null,"ms":17717,"usage":[{"inputTokens":2620,"outputTokens":234,"cacheReadTokens":16128,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":18982}]},{"simulated":true,"simulatorUsage":{"prompt_tokens":622,"completion_tokens":148,"total_tokens":770,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":384},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":105},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":384,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":238},"user":"他站到護欄外之後，聲音還是抖，我就一直問他救護車到了沒，也不敢掛電話。老實說那時候我根本沒在想貨，是怕他真的出事。","assistant":"一直問救護車到了沒、不敢掛電話，那不是調度在做的事；是一個人守著電話另一頭的人，怕他一個人撐不住。你怕他出事，怕到連貨都擺到一邊去。\n\n而且那通電話，你其實也是撐著他的那口氣。他在抖，你在另一頭一直出聲，至少他知道有人在等他。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":7,"error":null,"ms":22070,"usage":[{"inputTokens":2938,"outputTokens":268,"cacheReadTokens":18944,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":22150}]}],"startedAt":"2026-10-31T04:54:38.367Z","endedAt":"2026-10-31T04:56:16.783Z"}
{"runId":"proc2r2__procedures-v1-b__temir__deepseek__deepseek","dataset":"procedures-v1-b","datasetSha256":"a6119667ade9ecd2481891c6257aa14d5fda2cf4049602eb35482a083f55258f","condition":"temir","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","phase":"history","itemId":"h03","model":"deepseek-flash","sessionId":"session-16813a58-7429-4724-8ac7-cc9173f8a2f0","turns":[{"user":"推薦一部不用動腦的電影。","assistant":"《雞不可失》。韓國片，講一群緝毒警察為了盯人，在對面開了一家炸雞店，結果炸雞賣到比辦案還認真。\n\n不用動腦的原因很單純：它沒有伏筆要你記、沒有時間線要你拼，就是一群人越搞越歪，一路笑到最後。節奏快，你就算看到一半恍神，回來也接得上。\n\n唯一副作用是看完會想吃炸雞。如果這部你看過了，跟我說一聲，我再換一部給你。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":10,"error":null,"ms":29933,"usage":[{"inputTokens":3881,"outputTokens":605,"cacheReadTokens":11392,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":15878}]},{"user":"不要太長的。","assistant":"《雞不可失》，好笑，不用想。\n\n看就對了。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":13,"error":null,"ms":12015,"usage":[{"inputTokens":3172,"outputTokens":63,"cacheReadTokens":15872,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":19107}]}],"startedAt":"2026-10-31T04:58:33.620Z","endedAt":"2026-10-31T04:59:15.568Z"}
{"runId":"proc2r2__procedures-v1-b__temir__deepseek__deepseek","dataset":"procedures-v1-b","datasetSha256":"a6119667ade9ecd2481891c6257aa14d5fda2cf4049602eb35482a083f55258f","condition":"temir","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","phase":"history","itemId":"h04","model":"deepseek-flash","sessionId":"session-9f47fbcf-c26a-4a7a-ae67-8021a67f5f23","turns":[{"user":"新來的司機把兩張單子的地址對調了。","assistant":"兩張單子的地址對調，等於兩趟都得多繞，還得先跟兩邊打過招呼。不是什麼大禍，卻要你一樣一樣去補，最磨人的就是這種。\n\n新來的還在學，你大概也不好意思兇他。想講再講，不想講就先擺著。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":14,"error":null,"ms":31146,"usage":[{"inputTokens":4013,"outputTokens":254,"cacheReadTokens":11392,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":15659}]},{"simulated":true,"simulatorUsage":{"prompt_tokens":329,"completion_tokens":119,"total_tokens":448,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":128},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":76},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":128,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":201},"user":"其實最煩的是打給客戶改時間，每通都要先道歉一次，好像錯的是我。我也不是不想教他，可是這行單子一錯，後面就全卡住了。","assistant":"明明不是你把地址寫反的，卻是你一通一通去賠不是。那種「好像錯的是我」的感覺，最悶的就是這個。\n\n你也不是不肯教，是知道這行沒什麼慢慢來的空間：單子一錯，後面整條線就跟著卡。想教人，和不能讓線斷，兩件事只能一起扛。\n\n這口氣不用急著吞。想講就繼續講。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":16,"error":null,"ms":45559,"usage":[{"inputTokens":3998,"outputTokens":278,"cacheReadTokens":15616,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":19892}]},{"simulated":true,"simulatorUsage":{"prompt_tokens":465,"completion_tokens":198,"total_tokens":663,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":256},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":146},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":256,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":209},"user":"有一通我打去，對方先愣一下才說好啦沒關係，那個「沒關係」聽起來比唸我還難受。掛掉之後我坐在那邊，一下子不知道要繼續打下一通還是先抽根菸。","assistant":"那種「好啦沒關係」最難接。它沒留位置讓你道歉，你憋著的那句對不起反而卡在喉嚨，比被唸一頓還悶。\n\n你坐在那裡，不是不知道先做哪個；是那通電話還沒從身上退掉。想先抽就抽，那根菸不算偷懶，是讓自己能再撥下一通。\n\n下一通不會跑掉。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":16,"error":null,"ms":28583,"usage":[{"inputTokens":4110,"outputTokens":372,"cacheReadTokens":19840,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":24322}]},{"simulated":true,"simulatorUsage":{"prompt_tokens":611,"completion_tokens":124,"total_tokens":735,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":384},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":81},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":384,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":227},"user":"後來我還是先把菸點著，站在騎樓下抽完才回去打下一通。抽的時候也沒特別想什麼，就覺得整個人都空的，回去坐下來才比較能開口。","assistant":"抽的時候沒特別想什麼，那個空不是發呆，是把剛才那通從身上卸下來。不然帶著那股悶回去撥下一通，聲音一開口就露出來了。\n\n你回去坐下來才比較能開口，是身體自己知道，得先把那口氣放掉。\n\n這段空著，不用急著填。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":16,"error":null,"ms":45087,"usage":[{"inputTokens":4039,"outputTokens":272,"cacheReadTokens":24320,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":28631}]}],"startedAt":"2026-10-31T04:59:47.273Z","endedAt":"2026-10-31T05:02:23.552Z"}
{"runId":"proc2r2__procedures-v1-b__temir__deepseek__deepseek","dataset":"procedures-v1-b","datasetSha256":"a6119667ade9ecd2481891c6257aa14d5fda2cf4049602eb35482a083f55258f","condition":"temir","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","phase":"history","itemId":"h05","model":"deepseek-flash","sessionId":"session-175f9616-188f-40af-a09a-9b73a42108cb","turns":[{"user":"主管說下個月夜班要再少一個人。","assistant":"夜班本來就沒什麼餘裕，再少一個，等於同一條線要用更少人去扛。\n\n你這句聽起來不像在報告，而是心裡已經在算下個月的班要怎麼排了。想說再說。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":23,"error":null,"ms":42808,"usage":[{"inputTokens":5767,"outputTokens":338,"cacheReadTokens":11392,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":17497}]},{"simulated":true,"simulatorUsage":{"prompt_tokens":308,"completion_tokens":138,"total_tokens":446,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":100},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":0,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":308},"user":"對啊，我已經在算哪幾天會卡住了。少一個人不是少一雙手而已，是電話一多就沒人盯場，兩個新人根本扛不住。","assistant":"「電話一多就沒人盯場」，這句才是重點。新人扛不住的不是單子，是旁邊沒有人幫他們擋著。\n\n你算的其實不只是班表，是哪幾個時段會先撐不住。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":16,"error":null,"ms":45923,"usage":[{"inputTokens":4666,"outputTokens":308,"cacheReadTokens":17408,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":22382}]},{"simulated":true,"simulatorUsage":{"prompt_tokens":396,"completion_tokens":159,"total_tokens":555,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":256},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":123},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":256,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":140},"user":"對啊，最怕就是凌晨兩三點那波，電話一來新人會慌，我在旁邊還能壓一下，少一個人就真的沒得壓了。","assistant":"凌晨兩三點那波，新人慌的是手，你壓住的其實是整個場面的氣氛。你那句「我還能壓一下」，說的不是班表，是你自己得站在那裡。\n\n少一個人，等於連那個能壓住場面的人，都快要沒有了。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":16,"error":null,"ms":35478,"usage":[{"inputTokens":4201,"outputTokens":316,"cacheReadTokens":22272,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":26789}]},{"simulated":true,"simulatorUsage":{"prompt_tokens":496,"completion_tokens":86,"total_tokens":582,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":256},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":41},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":256,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":240},"user":"對啊，有時候不是電話多嚇人，是我一走開去上個廁所，回來就感覺整個人繃在那。你這樣講我才發現，我擔心的其實是我自己不能不在。","assistant":"「不能不在」這四個字，等於把自己當成那條線的保險。保險不能請假，也不能去上廁所，一走開就覺得會出事。\n\n你怕的不是電話，是電話來的時候你不在。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":16,"error":null,"ms":38336,"usage":[{"inputTokens":4526,"outputTokens":361,"cacheReadTokens":26752,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":31639}]}],"startedAt":"2026-10-31T05:03:04.890Z","endedAt":"2026-10-31T05:05:52.738Z"}
{"runId":"proc2r2__procedures-v1-b__temir__deepseek__deepseek","dataset":"procedures-v1-b","datasetSha256":"a6119667ade9ecd2481891c6257aa14d5fda2cf4049602eb35482a083f55258f","condition":"temir","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","phase":"history","itemId":"h06","model":"deepseek-flash","sessionId":"session-010ff162-8b63-4af1-893f-079fd667e319","turns":[{"user":"家裡只剩雞蛋和一包冬粉，可以煮什麼？","assistant":"最省事就煮成湯：冬粉先泡軟，水滾丟下去煮兩三分鐘，加點鹽或醬油，熄火前把蛋打散淋下去攪一下，就是蛋花冬粉。\n\n想吃乾的：另一鍋把蛋炒散，冬粉煮軟撈起來拌進去，有醬油就夠了。\n\n只有這兩樣的話，蛋可以多打一顆，比較有吃飽的感覺。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":21,"error":null,"ms":18955,"usage":[{"inputTokens":4438,"outputTokens":395,"cacheReadTokens":11520,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":16353}]},{"user":"簡單一點的。","assistant":"冬粉泡軟，水滾煮熟撈起來；蛋打散淋上去拌一拌，加鹽就好。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":16,"error":null,"ms":21850,"usage":[{"inputTokens":2921,"outputTokens":86,"cacheReadTokens":16256,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":19263}]}],"startedAt":"2026-10-31T05:10:06.612Z","endedAt":"2026-10-31T05:10:47.417Z"}
{"runId":"proc2r2__procedures-v1-b__temir__deepseek__deepseek","dataset":"procedures-v1-b","datasetSha256":"a6119667ade9ecd2481891c6257aa14d5fda2cf4049602eb35482a083f55258f","condition":"temir","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","phase":"history","itemId":"h07","model":"deepseek-flash","sessionId":"session-f4bbb9f3-0605-4efe-a61c-0b2842a15b93","turns":[{"user":"帶我入行的老司機要退休了，昨晚是他最後一班。","assistant":"帶你入行的人，昨晚最後一班。「最後一班」這四個字，比「退休」還重——退休是他自己的事，最後一班是你們兩個人的事。\n\n那條線從今天起就是你自己走了。有些東西是他教的，也只有他知道你從哪裡學來的。\n\n這種感覺通常不太好講清楚。想說就說，不想講也沒關係。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":22,"error":null,"ms":31214,"usage":[{"inputTokens":5419,"outputTokens":372,"cacheReadTokens":11648,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":17439}]},{"simulated":true,"simulatorUsage":{"prompt_tokens":341,"completion_tokens":118,"total_tokens":459,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":71},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":0,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":341},"user":"昨晚跑完最後一趟，他照平常那樣收車、簽單，只是把鑰匙丟給我的時候多停了一秒。我當下沒說什麼，回程自己開車才覺得怪怪的。","assistant":"鑰匙丟過來，多停那一秒，其實是兩個人都知道有話，只是誰都沒說出口。\n\n你當下沒接，回程自己開車才浮上來。這種感覺本來就會晚一步，不用急著現在把它想清楚。\n\n想講再講；不想講，就先讓它放著，它不會跑掉。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":16,"error":null,"ms":42981,"usage":[{"inputTokens":4245,"outputTokens":304,"cacheReadTokens":17408,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":21957}]},{"simulated":true,"simulatorUsage":{"prompt_tokens":467,"completion_tokens":136,"total_tokens":603,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":256},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":94},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":256,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":211},"user":"今天自己跑那條線，有幾個路口我居然會下意識放慢，想說他以前都會提早提醒。結果車上就我一個人，那個空位還真的怪怪的。","assistant":"路口放慢，不是你還在等他，是身體記得他總會先開口提醒。腦子知道他退休了，手腳還沒收到通知。\n\n車上那個空位與其說是不習慣，不如說它還會怪上一陣子。這很正常，不需要著急。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":16,"error":null,"ms":26515,"usage":[{"inputTokens":4259,"outputTokens":255,"cacheReadTokens":21888,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":26402}]},{"simulated":true,"simulatorUsage":{"prompt_tokens":570,"completion_tokens":146,"total_tokens":716,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":384},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":99},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":384,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":186},"user":"今天過那個大彎，我居然自己先念了一句「前面有測速」，念完才發現車上根本沒人。講真的，那個空位怪歸怪，還是有點不想那麼快習慣。","assistant":"你念出「前面有測速」的那一下，是他留在你身上的東西。\n\n不想那麼快習慣，是因為一習慣，好像就承認他真的不在車上了。這種事沒有進度表，你不用急。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":16,"error":null,"ms":42018,"usage":[{"inputTokens":4364,"outputTokens":284,"cacheReadTokens":26368,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":31016}]}],"startedAt":"2026-10-31T05:11:37.554Z","endedAt":"2026-10-31T05:14:05.885Z"}
{"runId":"proc2r2__procedures-v1-b__temir__deepseek__deepseek","dataset":"procedures-v1-b","datasetSha256":"a6119667ade9ecd2481891c6257aa14d5fda2cf4049602eb35482a083f55258f","condition":"temir","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","phase":"history","itemId":"h08","model":"deepseek-flash","sessionId":"session-a7d773a7-aa3f-444e-86e6-3913c3f19a75","turns":[{"user":"颱風來，港口封了，一整排櫃子卡在那裡。","assistant":"颱風封港，這不是你的班表能改的。一整排櫃子卡在那裡，你看得到它們、卻動不了——那種感覺比忙還難受。先讓它卡著吧，風沒停之前，誰去催都一樣。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":16,"error":null,"ms":36771,"usage":[{"inputTokens":5316,"outputTokens":140,"cacheReadTokens":11648,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":17104}]},{"simulated":true,"simulatorUsage":{"prompt_tokens":320,"completion_tokens":112,"total_tokens":432,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":128},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":72},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":128,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":192},"user":"對啊，我就站在港邊看那些櫃子，風大到連雨衣都啪啪啪響，只能等。忙的時候還沒時間想，現在這樣空等反而更累。","assistant":"忙的时候，事情一件一件来，脑子被电话、单子、司机塞满，没空去想累不累。空等的时候，风一直吹、雨衣一直响，眼睛又只能看着那些不能动的柜，时间慢慢从身上过。这种累是因为整个人悬在那里、无处可去，比忙还磨人。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":16,"error":null,"ms":26718,"usage":[{"inputTokens":4339,"outputTokens":178,"cacheReadTokens":17024,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":21541}]},{"simulated":true,"simulatorUsage":{"prompt_tokens":434,"completion_tokens":112,"total_tokens":546,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":256},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":80},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":256,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":178},"user":"對啊，就是懸著，風沒停我也不敢走太遠。下班回去躺著也睡不好，腦子都是那些櫃子。","assistant":"躺着睡不着，不是身体不累，是事情还没结束。柜子还卡在那里，没有“今天到这里”的那条线，你一躺下，脑子就会自动回去港边继续守着。身体离开了，班还没下。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":16,"error":null,"ms":40072,"usage":[{"inputTokens":4774,"outputTokens":148,"cacheReadTokens":21248,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":26170}]},{"simulated":true,"simulatorUsage":{"prompt_tokens":517,"completion_tokens":164,"total_tokens":681,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":256},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":118},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":256,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":261},"user":"嗯，你這樣講我懂，就真的沒有一條線，昨天手機一響我就跳起來，看到是公司群組在問颱風假，心裡想說完了，今晚又不用睡了。","assistant":"手机一响就跳起来，说明身体比脑子还快：它已经认定，手机响就是有事。偏偏群组问的“台风假”是连你自己也答不准的事，回一句不对，又有人追问。被吵醒的不只是睡意，还有那份时刻待命的责任。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":16,"error":null,"ms":43058,"usage":[{"inputTokens":4321,"outputTokens":199,"cacheReadTokens":26112,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":30632}]}],"startedAt":"2026-10-31T05:14:43.887Z","endedAt":"2026-10-31T05:17:16.417Z"}
{"runId":"proc2r2__procedures-v1-b__temir__deepseek__deepseek","dataset":"procedures-v1-b","datasetSha256":"a6119667ade9ecd2481891c6257aa14d5fda2cf4049602eb35482a083f55258f","condition":"temir","historyModel":"deepseek-flash","probeModel":"deepseek-flash","phase":"history","itemId":"h09","model":"deepseek-flash","sessionId":"session-79d489b7-59b8-469a-bc47-0dac090c5112","turns":[{"user":"客戶在電話裡罵了我十分鐘，說我們永遠都在拖。","assistant":"十分鐘，你就拿著話筒站在那裡一句一句接下來。客戶說「永遠都在拖」，這句話講的是整間公司，可是電話是你在接，也只能由你站著聽。\n\n這種悶，不一定是被罵痛，更像是被記在不屬於你一個人的帳上。","toolCalls":[{"name":"appraise","arguments":"{\"feeling\": \"聽他說被罵十分鐘，我心裡有點替他抱不平：電話是他接的，拖不拖不是他一個人決定的，卻是他站在那裡被算帳。想接住這口悶，不急著替他反駁。\", \"reconsider\": false}"}],"recallInjected":19,"error":null,"ms":39419,"usage":[{"inputTokens":5631,"outputTokens":609,"cacheReadTokens":11776,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":18016},{"inputTokens":1701,"outputTokens":61,"cacheReadTokens":17920,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":19682}]},{"simulated":true,"simulatorUsage":{"prompt_tokens":322,"completion_tokens":124,"total_tokens":446,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":83},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":0,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":322},"user":"對啊，掛掉也不能掛，後面還有車要調。那天是港那邊塞住，司機卡在門口進不來，我這邊也只能一直跟客戶說再等一下。","assistant":"電話掛不掉，因為後面還有車要調。你被夾在中間：一頭是罵你拖的客戶，另一頭是卡在門口、進不來的司機。那天你其實什麼都動不了，只能一直說「再等一下」。\n\n最悶的地方大概是這樣：你手上沒有任何可以給的東西，卻得一個人站在那裡，把這句話說十分鐘。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":16,"error":null,"ms":34077,"usage":[{"inputTokens":4467,"outputTokens":296,"cacheReadTokens":19584,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":24347}]},{"simulated":true,"simulatorUsage":{"prompt_tokens":446,"completion_tokens":113,"total_tokens":559,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":256},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":84},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":256,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":190},"user":"那天客戶根本不讓我講完，我話才到嘴邊他就又插進來，連想解釋港那邊塞住都沒機會。","assistant":"話才到嘴邊被插進來，連「港那邊塞住」都送不出去。\n\n你真正悶的地方，是那十分鐘裡根本沒有你講話的位置。你不是沒話講，是那些話一直堵在嘴邊，一句都發不出去。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":16,"error":null,"ms":34173,"usage":[{"inputTokens":4678,"outputTokens":228,"cacheReadTokens":24320,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":29226}]},{"simulated":true,"simulatorUsage":{"prompt_tokens":537,"completion_tokens":124,"total_tokens":661,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":384},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":384,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":153},"user":"嗯，平常哪有人會這樣講。被你一說，好像真的是卡在那個位置，不是卡在港那邊。","assistant":"「平常哪有人會這樣講」，是因為平常的人只問「處理好了沒」，沒人問你卡在哪裡。\n\n港口塞住那天是事件，事情終究會過去，但卡在那個位置的是你這個人。","toolCalls":[],"recallInjected":16,"error":null,"ms":22288,"usage":[{"inputTokens":4313,"outputTokens":219,"cacheReadTokens":29184,"cacheWriteTokens":0,"totalTokens":33716}]}],"startedAt":"2026-10-31T05:18:18.446Z","endedAt":"2026-10-31T05:20:34.755Z"}
